{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26235","headline":"登凤凰台二首 二 · 殷尧藩","name":"登凤凰台二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梧桐叶落秋风老，人去台空凤不来。\n梁武台成芳草合，吴王宫殿野花开。\n石头城下春生水，燕子堂前雨长苔。\n莫问人间兴废事，百年相遇且衔杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}